# What starts work and sets the architecture, and what runs the loop in CI
# (intent/self-running-loop/spec.md, R12). A PR that touches one of these waits for
# @brukhabtu. Anything else, the plugin's code included, merges once its required
# checks pass and every review conversation is resolved.

# Work starts, and the architecture is set, here.
/intent/*/intent.md @brukhabtu
/intent/*/spec.md @brukhabtu

# The workflows, the scripts they run and the file that names the full check, so a
# build can't change what CI runs, and this file, so a build can't change what waits
# for the owner.
/.github/workflows/ @brukhabtu
/.github/scripts/ @brukhabtu
/.claude/checks.json @brukhabtu
/.github/CODEOWNERS @brukhabtu
